{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ec199bde14e69265dcfb58fa11735a8c48116bc486a888b2a0fab241de745b8f", "ja": "（ニューヨーク滞在中。ホテルで寝ていたら、\n歩からの電話でたたき起こされた……）", "zh": "（在纽约逗留期间。睡在酒店里的时候，被步的电话给叫醒了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b86de0f1a998ee2c30b84f6551dda0814a68f71c2deb503b66e94251a0a55b19", "ja": "いやー、助かったよ{$P$}。\nまさか財布を忘れるとは思わなくてさ……。", "zh": "哎呀，真是帮大忙了，{$P$}。\n没想到我居然会忘带钱包……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "39685d655029766a7bae44899f52823f3e3b603c234526938339f5ec563acb1d", "ja": "まったく……電話越しに「助けて！」って\n叫ばれた時は、心臓が止まるかと思ったよ。", "zh": "真是的……你在电话那头大喊“救命！”的时候，\n我还以为心脏都要停跳了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4765ae6ac5d3795dd7337be3459771d22a48dca5db94eeb25d4ad459ee99e51d", "ja": "ほんとゴメン！\nなんか早く目が覚めちゃって、散歩してたんだ。", "zh": "真的很抱歉！\n不知怎么的，醒得特别早，就出来散步了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ab3e608c25969e36a14f96b4556347dd6a1cb1d7d820a70bb3b37b295e055a86", "ja": "そしたら、なんかいいにおいがしてきてさ！\nカフェでコーヒー飲んで帰ろうかな～って……。", "zh": "然后就闻到了一股香味！\n我想着要不要去咖啡馆喝杯咖啡再回去～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "db01d6163f139948578ead75701c86535e32257579b2baf37fb69267a55ad9c0", "ja": "後になって財布忘れたことに気づいたんだけど、\nもう注文が届いちゃって……あはは。", "zh": "后来才发现自己忘带钱包了，\n可点的东西都已经送上来了……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b0211a03cbbc1a5bda5689d4024d39da0d574041d9236bd376ff2144e98d1555", "ja": "まあ、気持ちはわかるけど……。\n歩にとっては、ホームみたいなものだもんな。", "zh": "嗯，我能理解你的心情……。对步来说，这里就像家一样嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4ede0194eec4ef55d7aac40673052be25d98c25828c813a6fbb8a5d6fe2f17a9", "ja": "イエス！　そうなんだよ。留学してた頃は、\nこの辺りをよく歩いてたんだ。楽しかったな～♪", "zh": "是的！就是这样。留学的时候，我经常在这一带散步。那段时光真开心啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1008_p", "source_sha256": "360c40e3940b111e7842d7b93ed11e989cb2b94bb95173a4532ca88664d22a6e", "ja": "それで懐かしくなって、店に入ったわけか。\n馴染みの街とはいえ外国なんだし、気をつけてくれよ。", "zh": "所以你是因为怀念这里，才进了那家店啊。虽说是熟悉的街道，但毕竟是在国外，要小心点啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bae623dbc1efa6b468156b23af9338192885ba0ca8ed2e7b26197fb41dbd044a", "ja": "うん、ほんとゴメン！　ホームだとか言っといて\nこんなミス、なんかカッコ悪いよね。あはは。", "zh": "嗯，真的很对不起！还说什么这是我的主场，结果却犯了这种错误，感觉真丢脸啊。哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b215d0cf59fed50bc4dc3db4e9580b7336186d7c48abb53f1586fd779da8531c", "ja": "カッコ悪いかどうかはともかく……歩だけカフェに\n行ってきたって聞いたら、みんなが文句を言うかもな？", "zh": "先不说丢不丢人……要是大家听说只有步去了咖啡馆，可能会抱怨吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "07a9fa116338ab5c15452fed6428f4de74c284a452dee4c0cb7be0b81ddd8f13", "ja": "あっ。しかも{$P$}とふたりだし、\nみんな、「ズルイ！」って怒るかも！？", "zh": "啊。而且还是跟{$P$}两个人一起，\n大家搞不好会生气地说“太狡猾了！”吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1012_p", "source_sha256": "51436cfa16ce34b699acb12ae9459f5119d742542e96511e07a86815a28fe9ba", "ja": "そうだな。\nそれじゃ、みんなが起き出す前に急いで帰ろうか。", "zh": "是啊。那我们趁大家还没醒，赶紧回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fdee75b28a3e607793e126499b770d5965da0c7f9c9628fc62b5ad2c3207c5ae", "ja": "あ、でも、その前に……\nせっかくだからさ、みんなにお土産買っていかない？", "zh": "啊，不过在那之前……\n难得来一趟，要不要给大家买点伴手礼带回去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c82e0fc607e4b926ffd7982190dbcc4f9b2f0e555423b61e3dcf9331fb77789f", "ja": "お土産って、こんな時間に？\nまだどこも開いてないんじゃ……。", "zh": "这个时间买伴手礼？  \n现在应该还没有店开门吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "983f5232665fd6755905912ad7944135ec5e2f68147e6b829f9a836cd08c12d3", "ja": "そういうお土産じゃなくって……\nこの先に、すっごくおいしいパン屋さんがあるんだよ！", "zh": "不是那种特产啦……\n前面有一家特别好吃的面包店哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8935cfd6a5418b38023d8b4b0084fd358fdbc7e8ef81a6dda7a4812269c58e3d", "ja": "そこのベーグルサンドを買って、\nみんなの朝ごはんにするってのはどう？", "zh": "买那家店的贝果三明治，作为大家的早餐怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e2c9fb5637a3f04e6262e59d5708410129bef10ff891b7c03370eecf63c2c09a", "ja": "なるほど、いいアイディアだな。\n出かけた言い訳にもできるし……。", "zh": "原来如此，这个主意不错。也能当作出门的借口……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6c518cf120dd4b6276785492922ac4f3e92ca60567ade485b25c6614a0422659", "ja": "やった！　そうと決まれば、急がなくっちゃ。\nあそこは人気があるから、すごく混むんだ。", "zh": "太好了！既然决定了，就得赶紧出发。\n那里很受欢迎，人会特别多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0153_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "64603f44d1b9e8d44baf3d4f846b62b67efadaeab66826b64dab59be7a0e1a7d", "ja": "行こう、{$P$}！\nこっちだよ！", "zh": "走吧，{$P$}！\n往这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
